        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 148321,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Si quisiéramos modificar cada elemento en un array y almacenar el resultado en un nuevo array, ¿cómo podríamos hacerlo?</p><p>Una forma de hacerlo es usar un bucle para convertir los valores antes de almacenarlos. Esto funciona, pero JavaScript tiene una solución aún mejor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"array\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"108\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element \" /><text value=\"of\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" d = \" /><text value=\"Math\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".max(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", element - \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage.push(d);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemyDamage</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 148322,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>JavaScript tiene una función útil llamada <code>.map()</code>, que, cuando se llama en un array, nos permite modificar cada valor y almacenarlo en un nuevo array.</p><p><code>.map()</code> sigue la sintaxis: <code>arrayName.map()</code>. Veamos cómo podemos llamarlo en el array <code>enemyDamage</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"reducedDamage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"86\" /><option startIndex=\"86\" endIndex=\"87\" /><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemyDamage</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y luego <code>map</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 148323,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para indicar a <code>.map()</code> cómo modificar cada elemento, necesitamos pasar una función como parámetro.</p><p>Más adelante programaremos nuestras modificaciones en esta función.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"87\" endIndex=\"95\" /><option startIndex=\"95\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"96\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"99\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"100\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>function</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 148324,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Antes de que podamos modificar los valores del array, necesitamos pasarlos a la función. Hacemos eso añadiendo un parámetro a la función inline.</p><p>En nuestro ejemplo, llamaremos al parámetro <code>element</code>, pero cualquier nombre puede funcionar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"86\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores = [\" /><text value=\"56\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"38\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" bonusUnlocked = scores.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (element % \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") == \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(bonusUnlocked);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 148325,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agregar un segundo parámetro nos permite acceder al índice de cada iteración junto con el valor del array.</p><p>En nuestro ejemplo, llamaremos al parámetro <code>index</code>, pero cualquier nombre puede funcionar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"118\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" displayInventory = inventory.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index + \" /><text value=\"&quot;: &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(displayInventory);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 148326,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para indicarle a la función <code>.map()</code> qué valor almacenar en el nuevo array, la función inline debe <code>return</code> un valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"108\" endIndex=\"114\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyDamage = [\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"8\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"14\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"17\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"15\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"19\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" reducedDamage = enemyDamage.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Math\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".max(\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", element - \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(reducedDamage);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 148327,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para simplificar nuestra sintaxis, podemos cambiar la función en línea por una función flecha de JavaScript en su lugar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"143\" /><option startIndex=\"144\" endIndex=\"165\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spriteNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;hero_idle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;slime_walk&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin_spin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;door_open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;boss_roar&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" uppercaseSprites = \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" spriteNames.map(\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element.toUpperCase());\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(uppercaseSprites);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code> seguido de <code>=&gt;</code> y finalmente <code>element.toUpperCase()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 148328,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>.map()</code> no solo funciona en arreglos de enteros, sino también en otros tipos de valores, como cadenas de texto.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Array\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"this\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"90\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyNames = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;hannah&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" nameLength =\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" enemyNames.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" element.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(nameLength);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemyNames</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 148329,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué función de JavaScript podemos usar para modificar cada elemento y almacenar los resultados en un nuevo array?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>.map()</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>.convert()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>.map()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 148330,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué necesitamos pasar como un parámetro para decirle a la función <code>.map()</code> cómo modificar cada elemento?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una función</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>element</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una función.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 148331,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Cómo podemos pasar los valores del array a la función inline de <code>.map()</code> para su modificación?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Al agregar un parámetro a la función inline</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Usando la sintaxis de corchetes</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Al agregar un parámetro a la función inline.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 148332,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué podemos acceder al incluir un segundo parámetro en la función inline de <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">El índice de iteración</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">El valor del array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">El índice de iteración.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 148333,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué debe incluir la función <code>.map()</code> para generar correctamente un nuevo array de valores?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Una declaración de retorno</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Sintaxis para modificar el valor del array</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una declaración de retorno.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 148334,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿Qué tipo de función podemos incorporar para simplificar la sintaxis de la función <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Una función flecha</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Una función en línea</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Una función flecha.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 148335,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>¿En qué tipo de array funciona <code>.map()</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Arrays de cualquier tipo</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Solo arreglos de <code>string</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Arrays de cualquier tipo.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 148336,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Llama a la función <code>.map()</code> en el array <code>values</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"7\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doubledLoot = values.map(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element*element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(doubledLoot);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>values</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y finalmente <code>map</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 148337,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega una función inline dentro de la función <code>.map()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option startIndex=\"89\" endIndex=\"90\" /><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemyTypes = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;dragon&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lengths = enemyTypes.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>function</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y luego <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 148338,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega el parámetro apropiado para darle a la función inline acceso a los valores del array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"86\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickups = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;heart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lengths = pickups.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(element);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #19",
            "id": 148339,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega los parámetros apropiados para dar a la función inline acceso a los valores e índices del array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"93\" endIndex=\"98\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pickups = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;gem&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;heart&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" debugPickups = pickups.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(element, index);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code> seguido de <code>index</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #20",
            "id": 148340,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica la palabra clave correcta para que la función <code>.map()</code> llene el array <code>places</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"100\" endIndex=\"106\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" players = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Archer&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" places = players.map(\" /><text value=\"function\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"element, index\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" index+\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\" + \" /><text value=\"&quot;. &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + element;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"});\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(places);}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>return</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #21",
            "id": 148341,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifica una función flecha que duplique cada valor dentro de la función <code>values.map()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"69\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" values = [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doubledDamage = values.map(\" /><text value=\"element\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\" =&gt;\" /><text value=\" element*\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(doubledDamage);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>element</code> seguido de <code>=&gt;</code> y luego <code>element</code>, <code>*</code>, <code>2</code>.</p></body></html>"
